(Chapter 3: Photosynthesis \(continued\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The overall reaction can be summarised by the equation:) Tj
T* (six carbon dioxide plus six water, in the presence of light, yields) Tj
T* (one glucose plus six oxygen.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Three main factors affect the rate of photosynthesis: light intensity,) Tj
T* (carbon dioxide concentration, and temperature. When one of these is in) Tj
T* (short supply it becomes the limiting factor, capping the overall rate) Tj
T* (no matter how favourable the others are.) Tj
